  {
    "index": 3,
    "hash": "C6UtGeAGXFz+hDYBuhAFOTjGiaw=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:30:43.759Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "Counterpoint Consulting has delivered Flowable across North America for more than ten years, and the record calls it the deepest pure-Flowable practice found. Pure matters here: it is not a large integrator with Flowable among many alliances but a firm whose practice is the platform, which is the strongest possible version of the carrier profile.\n\nThe disqualifier is entirely geographic \u2014 it is outside the EU beachhead \u2014 and that is a strategy constraint rather than a judgement about the firm. The thesis being sold leans on European sovereignty and procurement arguments that do not transfer to a US buyer, and a first design partner has to be reachable within the market where those arguments are already funded.\n\nWhich is why the row is deferred to priority 3 rather than excluded. Depth of practice is the scarcest attribute in this cohort, so if the beachhead ever widens, or if a US expansion is considered, this is the reference case for what a committed Flowable partner looks like. Provenance: Flowable Partner Finder, mined 2026-08-18, not imprint-swept.\n\n---\n\n## Leads sharing this finding (1)\n\n**3 \u00b7 later**\n- Counterpoint Consulting (US Reston VA) \u2014 counterpointconsulting.com\n\nVerbatim research text this claim was extracted from:\n\n> 10+ yrs delivering Flowable across North America \u2014 deepest pure-Flowable practice, but outside the EU beachhead \u00b7 SOURCE: Flowable Partner Finder (flowable.com/company/partners), mined 2026-08-18. NOT imprint-swept.",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-19T11:30:43.759274Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:30:43.759278Z"
    }
  },
